+## API keys and audit (schema 3)
+
+`apiKeys` contains `{ key, name, role }` records; roles are `viewer`, `cook`,
+or `manager`. Schema 2 migrates with an empty key list (no default access),
+preserving any existing keys and audit entries. Configure keys in the data
+file before serving migrated data. The seed contains one demo key per role.
